      "path": "/playground",
      "title": "Type a handle. Run the route.",
      "body": "The playground fills the path and calls the live API from the browser. The response renders as fields, with the raw JSON one tab over.",
      "points": [
        "One handle covers every row",
        "The status pill shows the code and the time",
        "Nothing is sent anywhere else"
